t-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>可以验证这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊗</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\otimes</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊗</span></span></span></span></span> 满足结合律。一旦满足结合律，就能用 Blelloch 扫描这类树形归约算法，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 步的链式依赖压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的并行深度——先两两合并，再四四合并，像锦标赛一样并行推进。这样即便参数随位置变化（卷积失效），训练依然能在 GPU 上并行展开。这正是 <a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a> 末尾说的「换一种方式并行」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"真正的瓶颈是内存搬运-不是算力\">真正的瓶颈是内存搬运，不是算力</h2><p>并行扫描只解决了计算依赖。Mamba 论文标题里的「硬件感知」指的是另一个更隐蔽的瓶颈——GPU 上真正贵的不是浮点运算，而是数据在内存层级间的搬运。</p>\n<p>问题出在隐状态的尺寸。每个位置的状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 大小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 个通道、每个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 维），把整条序列所有位置的状态都物化下来，是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\times d\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的庞然大物。如果朴素实现把它写进 GPU 的高带宽显存（HBM）再读回来，光是这趟搬运就会吃掉绝大部分时间。</p>\n<p>Mamba 的解法是<strong>核函数融合 + 重计算</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>融合</strong>：把离散化、扫描、输出读出全部塞进一个 CUDA 内核，让巨大的隐状态只活在片上高速 SRAM 里，绝不落盘到 HBM。只有最终的输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 才写回 HBM。</li>\n<li><strong>重计算</strong>：反向传播需要中间状态，但它们没被保存。Mamba 选择在反向时<strong>重新算一遍</strong>前向状态，而不是正向时存下来——重算的算力开销远小于搬运 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\times d\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 状态的内存开销。这是典型的「用算力换带宽」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套手法和 FlashAttention 的思路同源，都是围绕 GPU 内存层级做文章。下表对照朴素实现与硬件感知实现的差异。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>朴素扫描实现</th>\n<th>Mamba 硬件感知内核</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>隐状态存放</td>\n<td>物化到 HBM 显存</td>\n<td>只在片上 SRAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要开销</td>\n<td>HBM 读写带宽</td>\n<td>计算（可重叠）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反向传播</td>\n<td>读回保存的状态</td>\n<td>重计算前向状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内核数量</td>\n<td>多个分散内核</td>\n<td>单个融合内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长序列可扩展性</td>\n<td>受显存带宽墙</td>\n<td>接近算力上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mamba-2-与状态空间对偶\">Mamba-2 与状态空间对偶</h2><p>Mamba-1 的扫描内核是定制的，没法直接利用 GPU 上为矩阵乘法优化到极致的张量核心（Tensor Core），所以虽快但没榨干硬件。Mamba-2（Dao &amp; Gu，2024）的核心理论贡献是<strong>状态空间对偶</strong>（State Space Duality，SSD）。</p>\n<p>SSD 证明了一件深刻的事：选择性 SSM 的计算可以等价地写成一个特定结构的矩阵——具体说是一个「半可分矩阵」（semiseparable matrix）与输入的乘法，而这个矩阵乘法又可以分块，块内走类似注意力的二次计算、块间走线性递归。换句话说，<strong>选择性 SSM 和一种受限的线性注意力是同一个数学对象的两种算法</strong>。这就是 <a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a> 里埋下的「类比注意力」伏笔的严格版本。</p>\n<p>实践收益是巨大的：因为计算变成了矩阵乘法，Mamba-2 可以直接调用张量核心，比 Mamba-1 的纯扫描快数倍；同时它允许更大的状态维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>（Mamba-1 受限于 SRAM 容量难以放大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，Mamba-2 没这个束缚）。状态维变大意味着记忆容量变大，质量随之提升。SSD 还让 Mamba 层和注意力层在实现上更同构，更容易拼进混合架构——这是 2026 年 <a href=\"../applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">注意力混合架构</a> 几乎都基于 Mamba-2 而非 Mamba-1 的直接原因。</p>\n<p>下图把从选择性递归到 Mamba-2 高效执行的完整链路画出来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[选择性递归 h_k=Ā_k h_k-1+B̄_k u_k] --&gt; B[卷积失效, 退回串行]&#10;    B --&gt; C[发现: 满足结合律, 是前缀扫描]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Blelloch 并行扫描 O log L 深度]&#10;    D --&gt; E[硬件瓶颈: 隐状态 L×d×N 搬运]&#10;    E --&gt; F[核函数融合: 状态留在 SRAM]&#10;    E --&gt; G[重计算: 反向重算而非保存]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Mamba-1 定制扫描内核]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[Mamba-2 SSD: 重写为半可分矩阵乘法]&#10;    I --&gt; J[走张量核心, 更大状态维 N, 易混合注意力]\">graph TD\n    A[选择性递归 h_k=Ā_k h_k-1+B̄_k u_k] --&gt; B[卷积失效, 退回串行]\n    B --&gt; C[发现: 满足结合律, 是前缀扫描]\n    C --&gt; D[Blelloch 并行扫描 O log L 深度]\n    D --&gt; E[硬件瓶颈: 隐状态 L×d×N 搬运]\n    E --&gt; F[核函数融合: 状态留在 SRAM]\n    E --&gt; G[重计算: 反向重算而非保存]\n    F --&gt; H[Mamba-1 定制扫描内核]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[Mamba-2 SSD: 重写为半可分矩阵乘法]\n    I --&gt; J[走张量核心, 更大状态维 N, 易混合注意力]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么这一篇值得单独存在\">为什么这一篇值得单独存在</h2><p>把硬件单独抽出来讲，是因为 SSM 的成败有一半压在这里。同样的选择性算法，朴素实现可能比 Transformer 还慢，根本没有卖点；而硬件感知内核让它在长序列上实测吞吐反超注意力数倍。理论上的复杂度优势（<a href=\"../foundations/sequence-modeling-landscape\">序列建模格局</a> 那张表里的近线性）只有落到这套内核上才兑现成真实的墙钟时间。这也是为什么训练 SSM 时调内核、对齐内存布局会直接影响吞吐，相关工程注意点见 <a href=\"../practice/training-stability-tricks\">训练稳定性技巧</a> 和 <a href=\"../practice/benchmarks-vs-transformers\">与 Transformer 的对比</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>选择性递归满足结合律，属于前缀扫描，可用 Blelloch 树形归约把链式依赖压成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并行深度，即便卷积失效也能并行训练。</li>\n<li>GPU 的真正瓶颈是内存搬运而非算力；Mamba 用核函数融合（状态只留 SRAM）+ 反向重计算（用算力换带宽）避开了把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L\\times d\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 隐状态写回显存。</li>\n<li>Mamba-2 的状态空间对偶（SSD）证明选择性 SSM 与受限线性注意力数学等价，可重写为半可分矩阵乘法，从而走张量核心、放大状态维、易与注意力混合。</li>\n<li>硬件感知实现是 SSM 理论复杂度优势兑现为真实速度的关键一环，也是 2026 年混合架构普遍基于 Mamba-2 的原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>选择性为何破坏卷积、逼出扫描：<a href=\"mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a>。</li>\n<li>基于 Mamba-2 的混合模型配方：<a href=\"../applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">注意力混合架构</a>。</li>\n<li>复杂度优势的源头对照：<a href=\"../foundations/sequence-modeling-landscape\">序列建模格局</a>。</li>\n<li>GPU 内核、混合精度等通用加速背景：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/speculative-decoding\">LLM 服务与推理系统 · 推测解码</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"硬件感知并行扫描","id":"硬件感知并行扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把串行递归并行化的前缀扫描","id":"核心概念-把串行递归并行化的前缀扫描"},{"level":2,"text":"真正的瓶颈是内存搬运，不是算力","id":"真正的瓶颈是内存搬运-不是算力"},{"level":2,"text":"Mamba-2 与状态空间对偶","id":"mamba-2-与状态空间对偶"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这一篇值得单独存在","id":"为什么这一篇值得单独存在"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Mamba 选择性状态空间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/architectures/mamba-selective-ssm"},"next":{"title":"长序列建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications/long-sequence-modeling"}}